lass=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Ice\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Ice <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Freezing Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_Big_4dcec8.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Fire\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Fire <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Burning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_Big_a56686.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\nNear the <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Troll%20Cave\">Thais Troll Cave</a> entrance (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32471,32259,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32471, 32259, 7)</a>) during the <a href=\"#/quest/horse-station-world-change\">Horse Station World Change</a>. <div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"f2a63d5218adf5f815cc938367ae5dd1\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:178px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Wild_Horse_spawn_locations-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:176px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"The yellow dots are the spawn locations\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The yellow dots are the spawn locations\" height=\"176\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wild_Horse_spawn_locations_11a8f4.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Wild Horse spawn locations.png (506 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The yellow dots are the spawn locations</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA wild horse attacks in melee range. A wild horse will retreat at 75  (100%, full) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThey yield no loot or experience. If you kill it, you will see the following message: <span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">With its last strength the horse runs to safety.</span> If you want to tame one, you can put <a href=\"#/wiki/Parcel\">Parcels</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Crate\">Crates</a> around the spawn to trap them.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ungulates\">Ungulates</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Clomp\">Animated Clomp</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Sheep\">Black Sheep</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Vixen\">Black Vixen</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bloodback\">Bloodback</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boar\">Boar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeast</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Clomp\">Clomp</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cow\">Cow</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darkfang\">Darkfang</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deer\">Deer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Desperate%20White%20Deer\">Desperate White Deer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Doom%20Deer\">Doom Deer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dreadbeast\">Dreadbeast</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dromedary\">Dromedary</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Forest%20Fury\">Elder Forest Fury</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elephant\">Elephant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ember%20Beast\">Ember Beast</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enraged%20White%20Deer\">Enraged White Deer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Evil%20Sheep\">Evil Sheep</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Evil%20Sheep%20Lord\">Evil Sheep Lord</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Forest%20Fury\">Forest Fury</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gore%20Horn\">Gore Horn</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Greedbeast\">Greedbeast</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Horse%20%28Brown%29\">Horse (Brown)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Horse%20%28Grey%29\">Horse (Grey)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Horse%20%28Taupe%29\">Horse (Taupe)